                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a1cb164-2e9c-3e0b-a927-e11a08c0ca4d",
                                        "entry_id": "d19d48de-de1d-3073-b4da-c4141ccda3a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abbreviation of projects (“multi-story low-income housing development”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "New-York-City",
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4ee6d4d-e818-426c-a21c-f71558cd9d27",
                                                "sense_id": "4a1cb164-2e9c-3e0b-a927-e11a08c0ca4d",
                                                "text": "How long have you been living in the Ps?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "992f4f7d-598b-444d-935c-93be1f10f977",
                                                "sense_id": "4a1cb164-2e9c-3e0b-a927-e11a08c0ca4d",
                                                "text": "everyone in the hood had a lawsuit except me i wish i lived in the Ps so i could've been eating wild led paint chips i would've been up at least a mil right now"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "484993f0-8502-43b4-a261-5bc450e74111",
                                                "sense_id": "4a1cb164-2e9c-3e0b-a927-e11a08c0ca4d",
                                                "text": "Clearly not a lot of people from the hood on this thread. Every hood got a couple white kids that came up in the Ps and talks just like everyone else around."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d81ad9d-285a-40c8-a4d4-c6a16ba518d0",
                                                "sense_id": "4a1cb164-2e9c-3e0b-a927-e11a08c0ca4d",
                                                "text": "Not everyone who lives in the Ps is immediately gang affiliated, you monumental herb. Quit presenting classist stereotypes as fact."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddc4c55c-d43f-414d-a45b-23302210492f",
                                                "sense_id": "4a1cb164-2e9c-3e0b-a927-e11a08c0ca4d",
                                                "text": "Of course the numbers is like this. Its more people. Here's a broader view. A street in Compton, 20 to 30 houses, generally 3 to 5 ppl per household. Now a street in the Tremont section, bout 40 5 or 6 story buildings in one block, apts A-G, 3 to 5 ppl per household, and I haven't even mentioned big developments such as (RPT, Twin Parks, the Ps). We packed in this bitch like sardines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
